WEBVTT

00:23:59.851 --> 00:24:02.270
and no action is too small
to transform the world.

00:24:02.312 --> 00:24:04.272
It's like we are all one body,

00:24:04.314 --> 00:24:07.150
and every part of that body
has different actions.

00:24:07.192 --> 00:24:11.029
So it's a place of finding your part
and lot in the body and say,

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:12.197
I would do this.

00:24:12.238 --> 00:24:14.115
That if you are in law,

00:24:14.157 --> 00:24:17.285
we did an event about law together --

00:24:17.327 --> 00:24:19.120
MR: Yes, at COP26.

00:24:19.162 --> 00:24:20.371
VN: At COP26.

00:24:20.413 --> 00:24:22.081
So if you are in law,

00:24:22.081 --> 00:24:25.126
you can find your place
in what you're doing

00:24:25.168 --> 00:24:27.504
that as a lawyer or as a judge,

00:24:27.545 --> 00:24:29.547
you're going to support
different activists

00:24:29.589 --> 00:24:31.716
because you've seen
activists take, you know,